# Upstream files removed from the Antharchy tree.
#
# Each path must exist in the pinned upstream commit. If one does not,
# apply-overlay.sh fails: upstream already deleted it and this list is stale.

# 37signals web apps. Antharchy ships Claude and the Anthropic Console in
# their place (see overlay/applications/). The mailto handler that backed
# HEY.desktop goes with them -- patches 0030 and 0040 remove the two places
# upstream wires it up.
applications/Basecamp.desktop
applications/HEY.desktop
bin/omarchy-webapp-handler-hey

# Icons for the two removed web apps.
applications/icons/Basecamp.png
applications/icons/HEY.png
